WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:32.140
Even after Cosmo and the others fled into subspace, the Buff Clan aliens continued to attack the Solo Ship.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:39.440
They were willing to sacrifice their
own warship to take down the Solo Ship.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:45.160
However, the Ideon turned the tables on them.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:51.620
The Solo Ship continued to travel through an unknown part of space.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:03.810
<b>Surprise Attack - The Bajin Plan</b>

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.840
The gravity is 1.2, and the mass is 0.97.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.940
Surface temperature 23 degrees.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:23.590
What about the atmosphere?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.460
98% Nitrogen,

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:27.350
0.8% Argon,

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.320
and the rest consists mostly of various inert gases.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.830
That's quite unusual.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.760
It seems sufficient for repairing the Solo Ship.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.250
Standby for landing!

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.710
Altitude 30,000!

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.480
These look like plants...

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.880
Giant plants?

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:54.310
The surface seems to be a mixture of various different materials.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.030
Altitude 0. We're landing.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:16.920
I've got to hold on!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.870
Don't fall, Deck!

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.700
We've landed!

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.180
Examine the atmosphere.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.560
The Ideon gauge turned on again...

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.930
I wonder what that means?

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.320
The jets started working before we laid a finger here.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.490
You don't know what happened?

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.340
No.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:49.740
Flying objects approaching!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.710
Their speed is 700 kilometers per hour,
three fighter-like objects!

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.310
Bajins!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.380
You know about them?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.510
I remember...

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:06.970
Does the Buff Clan's sphere of influence extend even to this planet?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:08.530
No.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.950
Two years ago, this planet was first explored by Abadede.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.440
I remember hearing a report about it.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.900
Abadede?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.230
The Buff Clan man who's been chasing us?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:17.960
Yes.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.150
No way...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.400
Could we have fallen into a trap?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.370
Even though you failed to defeat the Logo Dau aliens,

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.750
I'm grateful that you planted the
 transmitter device on their ship.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.760
I am unworthy of such compliments, Sir.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.880
Two years ago, I came here with the Gaira Research Team.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.180
Message from Lady Harulu!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.230
Very well, put it on the main screen!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.830
Abadede Grimade.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:03.280
I grant you permission to speak with Lady...

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.030
Drop the formalities.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:05.810
Ma'am!

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.490
Abadede, it's been a long time.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.150
Lady Harulu, are you doing well?

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.330
How could I be doing well!?

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:20.790
But, with Lady Karala in the hands of the enemy,
I thought we could take any means necessary...

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.630
Who said you could sacrifice the Gram Zan?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.730
Considering my sister's exceedingly selfish behavior,

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:31.710
we shouldn't hesitate to sacrifice her, if it's for the sake of the Buff Clan.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.470
Yes.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.600
If a war has started with the aliens...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:41.020
We have no choice but to make ourselves known and strike them down completely.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:45.940
Even Supreme Commander Doba has said
it might be necessary to sacrifice his child.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.280
So it's just as Sir Abadede said.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.200
Gije!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:50.900
Ma'am!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.230
Do you comply?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.910
Do you comply?!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.370
Understood, Lady Harulu.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.710
You're nothing but a lot of cowards.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.840
Once we meet up, I'll show you my methods of command.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.750
You will?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.910
She's grown into a stubborn, unlikable woman.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:11.550
Well, that's why Lord Doba wishes she had been born a man...

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.920
She's quite irritated about that.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.390
Are we to wait for Lady Harulu to arrive before attacking?

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.620
My pride as a man won't allow it.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.670
Are we launching another attack?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.830
It's my fault that the Gram Zan was destroyed.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.980
I'll head out alone in the Dogg Mack.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.780
That's far too reckless!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:32.360
Do you know why the Gaira Research Team was destroyed?

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:35.190
I heard they got into a battle with aliens.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.990
Aliens? No.

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.310
It was the Bajin!

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.450
Bajin?!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.500
Cosmo! Here's the note from Sheryl.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.180
In the 6th Civilization machine,

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.800
Switch A1, B1, B2, C1...

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.140
Part A is ready!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.290
I'm all set too.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.190
Pull your levers at the same time.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:02.870
Got it?

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:03.520
Three,

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.520
Two,

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.210
One,

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:05.770
Zero!

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.660
Damn it! Is that thing only for decoration?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.660
Is the water flowing now?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.950
Thanks! It's working fine now!

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.120
Don't we have any better bath unit than this?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.800
Lin! Here's Lou!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:29.890
Okay!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.360
Deck, good work.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.670
What?

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.930
Was it a good bath?

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.930
Tell Ashura to come here!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:37.610
Yes.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:38.430
Deck!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.480
Get in too, I'll wash your hair for you!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.980
I can do it myself.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.160
We have to learn the language of the 6th Civilization.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.770
After that, we should be able to operate the Solo Ship perfectly.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:00.450
We're doing all we can here.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.390
We're counting on you.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.580
How's it going?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.460
We understand some of the main points,

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.230
but it's full of technical terms.

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:07.660
What do you want?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.560
I was looking for you.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.380
No one could tell me where you were...

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.510
What is it?

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.660
This is a Kuzurau translator.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:31.440
We use it to decipher over 150 different languages used on our home planet.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.490
Yeah, right!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.690
No, Sheryl!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.050
If we tried different methods, it could help us out.

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:38.970
Let's borrow it.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:42.110
Alright. Please give it over.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.150
Here you go.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:46.660
Will you be alright without your translator, Karala?

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:50.660
I've learned most of your words. I'll be okay.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.470
Is that enough?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.890
Hey, could you bring back a baby Nejipiko as a souvenir?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.430
Everyone else owns one! Promise me!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:09.600
You pamper her so much, she has a hard time parting with you.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:13.900
I learned that I'm going to give birth to a baby boy.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.810
You'll be returning as planned, right?

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.860
You don't have to worry about that souvenir, Dear.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.740
I'll be praying for you safety.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:26.370
Is that so? I thought she had put on some weight.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.750
The Dogg Mack is ready to launch!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.000
Good!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.010
The maintenace is perfect.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.550
I'd expect no less from the Gataman Zan's crew.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.740
Is he going to be alright alone?

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.360
That man is an unyielding samurai.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.560
He'll utilize the Bajin to attack.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.970
It'll be a sight to behold!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:52.390
The transmitter can last only for so long.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:59.440
We've detected objects resembling spaceships! Stay alert!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.330
They shouldn't have found our whereabouts.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.580
It must be a coincidence.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.510
But they seem to be like Buff Clan machines.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:07.580
Call Hatari!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.670
He's an expert on these things.

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.790
All crew, be on alert!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.670
Unidentified flying objects are approaching!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.290
Everyone, move to combat positions!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.210
Can't I ever do maintenance in peace?

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.050
Isn't this just a false alarm?

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:28.940
Solo Ship!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.830
Is that really an enemy? Haven't you made a mistake?

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.300
Examine them closer!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.250
Wait!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.530
We're currently investigating.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.130
It's hard to tell the indigenous 
organisms apart from machines.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.570
Obviously!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.050
That's why we can dwell here without being discovered!

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.730
Well, that's true, but...

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:45.900
Stay on alert for now.

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.290
Really?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.140
Lotta!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.760
Where's Banda Lotta?

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.540
Where's my meal?

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.670
It's being prepared. Hold on.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:56.830
What's this?

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.200
Our transmitter device is truly reliable.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.390
The enemy can go 10 thousand light years
and we'll still know where they are.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:26.690
Based on the satellite data, it certainly seems like a spaceship, but...

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:30.170
It's hard to get accurate results while we're on this planet.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:33.740
Well, it's like we're encased in a giant ball of metal.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:36.250
Did you see Sheryl?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:36.850
Yes.

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.170
Look at this.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.370
It uses an ionocraft to fly.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.880
Can we determine whether it's an organism or an enemy?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:46.200
We've stopped our anti-matter engine.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.360
I think the enemy has done the same.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.770
Since they can't detect anything,

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.060
the assailant has the largest advantage.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.280
All right!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.030
Shall I begin my strategy?

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:22.830
Found them.

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:34.810
Since you previously took out the investigation team,

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.850
This time I'll make use of you.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.270
There's the Bajin nest.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.260
Here they come!

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.100
Hey!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.850
I need you to follow me!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.940
This should be enough.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:36.810
Listen, Bes!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.060
Some kind of strange swarm is closing in on us!

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.150
A swarm?

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.630
I'll magnify them on the front screen!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:45.090
There seems to be about 320 to 330 of them.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:48.090
They appear to be those Bajin Karala was talking about.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:54.570
It can't be the Buff Clan. You'd need a whole fleet of ships to load that many units.

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:56.550
It would take 7 or 8 vessels.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:05.100
They're coming!

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.790
It's not just the Bajin!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.950
What's that leading them?

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.030
Launch the Ideon immediately!

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:16.580
Roger!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.150
What's wrong with the power?

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:27.990
The fuel intake is stuck!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:30.340
All missile ports, fire back at them!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.100
What's that?! A Bajin corpse?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.220
What?

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:53.990
They're attacking the Solo Ship?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.410
Why are they attacking us?!

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.720
Lin! Get the kids inside!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:11.580
Yes!

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:19.980
What is the Ideon doing?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.230
Put the ship's engine to full power!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.530
Have all the workers evacuated?

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:25.230
I'm going to close it!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.020
Okay!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:39.280
It doesn't matter how many Bajins you
shoot down, you're only going to attract more of them!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.740
Okay, this is my chance.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.050
I hope you can hear me through the communication channel.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.860
Lady Karala, can you hear me?

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.090
It is I, Abadede!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.730
What are these sounds?

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.290
It's being transmitted through the walls.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.680
Is this a Buff Clan language?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:10.650
I can't do it.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.400
Because of the Bajin
attack, I can't locate sound's origins...

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:13.990
That Abadede!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.110
He's waiting for me at the back of the Solo Ship?

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:20.910
How does he dare to come now, after having casted me aside?

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:21.780
Karala!

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:23.160
I got it, Bes!

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:24.660
What?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:29.980
The Bajin are fighting to avenge their companions!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:30.940
What the?

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:33.470
You mean the more we kill, the more they will attack us?

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.100
Damn them all!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.060
I'll shoot them all down!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:47.810
Vent!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.700
If the main engine doesn't start working, we'll all die!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.740
In a minute! Just hold on!

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.660
How impolite.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.540
Lady Karala!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.750
I've come to take you back!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.120
Please make haste!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.390
Was it my father's order to cast me aside?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.000
Or was it the order of my sister Harulu?

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.080
Answer me, Abadede!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.200
I haven't received such an order.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:23.320
That is why I've come in person to take you back.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.800
I am no longer a child.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.940
Who decided to cast me aside?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.480
I must abide by the code of samurai.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.400
I cannot answer that.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.730
Then forget it.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.450
Please tell my father and sister this.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.900
I've abandoned that Buff Clan way of life.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.720
Lady Karala!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:45.380
If I return, they'll promote you.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.050
However, Abadede...

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:52.000
I believe that the Buff Clan way of life isn't the only correct path for humanity.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.300
These people have proved me that.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.760
Lady Karala!

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.360
I praise your bravery.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:02.380
But this is where it ends. I don't care if you view me as a fool.

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.470
Lady Karala!

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:09.430
One of the Buff Clan?!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.310
Step back!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.680
If you're going to shoot this woman, you have to shoot me first!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.010
Lady Karala!

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.860
You shall come to regret this!

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:31.740
You can forget about getting any thanks from me.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.210
That's just like you, isn't it?

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.980
Like parent, like child...

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:57.690
Are all nobles like this? I don't want her to end up like that...

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:03.360
Hey, can you bring me a Nejipiko as a souvenir? Everyone else owns one!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:06.870
I just want to finish my work and return home quickly.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.620
Let's get out of this room!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:11.620
It's going to run out of air!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.520
Bes!

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.590
The normal engine is okay! The Ideon gauge should be working!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.330
What?

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.590
Hatari!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.820
Yes, launching!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.470
Civilians, get to the center of the ship!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.220
Crew members, make sure we're airtight!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.140
Moera!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.430
The power has risen!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:30.980
Let's go!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:31.980
Okay!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.280
How can this be?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.860
How can they fly after taking so much damage from the Bajin?

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.450
Damn you!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.540
Techno!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.960
Did the Glen Cannon get destroyed?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.010
Kasha, just fire, never mind the Bajin!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:01.670
I can't!

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:05.070
Half our missiles are obstructed and will explode if fired!

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:08.380
In any case, this is their last stand! I'll finish you off!

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.230
Not again!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.020
I see... Watch this!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.320
Don't get cocky!

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:29.280
There!

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.000
What do you hope to achieve with your childish tricks?

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:36.850
I knew it, if the Bajin die, more will be called!

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:37.790
Let's go!

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.660
What?!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:45.970
Oh no!

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.170
The Bajin?!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.500
The Bajin are attacking!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:06.110
How can the aliens' giant and their spaceship endure this?

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:17.660
Are they being protected by the Giant of Ide?!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.280
Why...

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:29.630
Why must I die in such a shameful manner?

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:45.980
He's gone!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.820
Sir Abadede's Dogg Mack...

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:56.370
Just what happened on that planet?

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:02.160
The Bajin have been completely removed.

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:05.550
But the deck has been severely damaged.

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:07.600
What is the enemy ship doing?

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:09.650
It seems that as of now-

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:10.710
Oh.

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:12.760
They've transferred into subspace.

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:15.920
Did they give up on us?

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:21.120
Abadede Grimade...

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:23.370
A man who only lived for loyalty and devotion...

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:25.020
There's nothing appealing about that.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.750
The Buff Clan translator doesn't work either.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:31.860
We have to think of yet another method.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.330
The Solo Ship again heads into a different part of space.

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:44.750
However, they have yet to escape from Gije's pursuit.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:54.680
<i>The Buff Clan's recon devices chase the Solo Ship.</i>

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:56.240
<i>Harulu and Guhaba...</i>

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.180
<i>Two new enemies put the Ideon's power to test with a fierce attack.</i>

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:06.090
<i>Cosmo and the others are played around
by the Buff Clan's new mecha, Zigg Mack.</i>

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>Can they defeat the new machine?</i>

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:14.570
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Pursuit to the Planet of Ruins"</i>

